1034
01:04:16.937 --> 01:04:19.021
Yeah. Just fine.

1035
01:04:20.440 --> 01:04:24.026
You wouldn't happen to know what
the state bird of New Jersey is. would you?

1036
01:04:25.195 --> 01:04:28.614
