1071
01:06:43.541 --> 01:06:45.209
What the hell are you talking about?

1072
01:06:45.377 --> 01:06:48.045
Nelson says he's got a pretty
little baby helping him out.

1073
01:06:48.213 --> 01:06:50.589
What's Matt Nelson doing
