1080
01:07:10.276 --> 01:07:12.528
You're a real team player.
aren't you. Phillip?

1081
01:07:12.696 --> 01:07:14.822
lt's just business. Don't take it so personal.

1082
01:07:14.989 --> 01:07:17.908
l'm not after your job
because l want director of scouting.

1083
01:07:18.076 --> 01:07:22.121
l'm after your job because l want to be
the G.M. You know how it is.

1084
01:07:22.914 --> 01:07:24.873
Get the hell out of my office.

1085
01:07:25.041 --> 01:07:26.291
[CELL PHONE BEEPS]

1086
01:07:39.639 --> 01:07:40.681
Nice shot.

1087
01:07:40.849 --> 01:07:43.434
-Uh. l got the Landau research.
-Oh.

1088
01:07:43.601 --> 01:07:47.646
l agree with Mickey there's precedent.
l don't think it's our strongest position.

1089
01:07:47.814 --> 01:07:49.565
l've outlined my approach a bit different.

1090
01:07:49.733 --> 01:07:54.987
l know you have a hard deadline for the
presentation. so l'm here if you need me.

1091
01:07:55.155 --> 01:07:56.155
