l gotta stop.

1468
01:34:46.222 --> 01:34:48.932
Hi. l'm Mickey.

1469
01:34:49.100 --> 01:34:51.060
l've been watching.
it's really impressive.

1470
01:34:51.227 --> 01:34:52.728
