This isn't an open tryout.

1493
01:36:40.253 --> 01:36:43.714
l've seen him.
l swear to you. he's the real thing.

1494
01:36:43.882 --> 01:36:45.340
PETE:
There's no paperwork on the kid.

1495
01:36:45.508 --> 01:36:49.219
l just can't parade him out on the field
and let him pitch.

1496
01:36:49.387 --> 01:36:52.723
l'm here because of you. Pete. okay.
so l don't care what you have to do.

1497
