1501
01:37:09.866 --> 01:37:12.701
Thank God we sent Matt down there
or we would have missed on this kid.

1502
01:37:12.869 --> 01:37:14.912
That kid can't hit a curve.

1503
01:37:15.747 --> 01:37:18.582
Gus. now that we're all aware
of your condition...

1504
