Gentry knows it's coming.
he still can't hit it.

1556
01:41:54.859 --> 01:41:55.901
Shit!

1557
01:41:56.068 --> 01:41:58.320
Jesus Christ. who is this kid?

1558
01:41:58.488 --> 01:42:01.198
GUS:
What do you say now. jackass?

1559
