than anyone in this room.

1571
01:42:37.610 --> 01:42:38.819
lt's okay. Dad.

1572
01:42:38.986 --> 01:42:42.155
No. lt's in my blood
and it's in your blood too.

1573
01:42:43.366 --> 01:42:45.617
l want you to be happy. that's all.

1574
01:42:51.165 --> 01:42:53.333
Here's the reports
from last night's game.

1575
01:42:53.876 --> 01:42:54.960
